  "prefLabel": "He-W 693.01 Applicability",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-08-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 693.01 Applicability. These rules shall apply to any individual who obtains, attempts to obtain, or aids or abets any individual in obtaining financial assistance to needy families (FANF) benefits to which the individual is not entitled.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #6008, eff 3-24-95; ss by #7834, eff 2-24-03, ss by #9871, INTERIM, eff 2-24-11, EXPIRES: 8-23-11; ss by #9983, eff 8-23-11; ss by #12901, eff 10-22-19",
